  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LevelMapNode
  levelName: The Boring Green Starting Place
  levelSummary: "You just got dropped onto the map, and your chest is already ticking
    like crazy! Before you dive into the deep parts of your brain, you have to sprint
    through this bright green field. It\u2019s mostly just grass, flowers, and weird
    cardboard cutouts showing you how to jump and roll. Keep moving, learn the controls,
    and don\u2019t let the signal catch up before you even get started!"
